# Scratch SQL at the repo root only (check_*.sql, fix_*.sql, etc.).
#
# This was previously a blanket `*.sql`, which silently hid real project source:
# the baseline schema and security-hardening migrations went uncommitted for
# months, and it would also have swallowed supabase/tests/. Anchor the rule to
# the root so anything under supabase/ is tracked.
/*.sql

